Module route files live here, one per module: <module>.php.

Collected by App\Support\Routing\ModuleRouteLoader, which routes/api.php calls.
Do not add endpoints to routes/api.php — that is what this directory is for, and
it is why two concurrent tracks never edit the same route file (decision D-8).

Files are loaded in sorted filename order. Do not repeat the /api/v1 prefix;
bootstrap/app.php already applies it.

This placeholder keeps the directory in git. The loader collects *.php only, so
it is never mistaken for a route file.
